0 FILE tidal_trio.ldr
0 TIDAL TRIO / three-motor kinetic wave engine / v1.0
0 Name: tidal_trio.ldr
0 Author: OpenAI
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see README.txt
0 // Original digital prototype; physical build and hardware operation remain untested.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; three stationary medium angular motors.
0 // All LEGO parts are standard references. No non-LEGO supplies required.
0 // See README.txt and the illustrated assembly guide before building.
0 // Parked phases: 0.0 degrees, 0.0 degrees, 0.0 degrees
0 // Manual zero for the controller: all crank output joints point right.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 01_chassis.ldr
0 STEP
0 // Attach the left linkage module.
1 16 -280 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 02_module.ldr
0 STEP
0 // Add the next module, then place and connect the hub.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 03_module.ldr
0 STEP
0 // Add the next module, then place and connect the hub.
1 16 280 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 04_module.ldr
0 STEP
0 // Add the next module, then place and connect the hub.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 05_console.ldr
